{
  "id": "RAW_7206b44e11",
  "title": "智谱发布 GLM-5.4 视觉编程模型，商汤推出 SenseNova U1.6 图像生成与编辑模型",
  "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkyMzcwMDIyMQ==&mid=2247504176&idx=1&sn=7ab7d1e9dbebfbbe737a714b4c2caa4b",
  "date": "2026-11-24 18:30:00",
  "author": "机器之心SOTA模型",
  "siteName": "机器之心SOTA模型",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p>原创 <span>每日发现最新</span> <span>2026-11-24 18:30</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block;\">中国香港</span></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124134501_b4700e5.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p>通用推理与任务执行模型GLM-5.4，图文工作流模型Ling-3.2-air，健康信号处理模型LingSante-Pulse，多语翻译模型腾讯Hy-MT3，图像生成与编辑模型SenseNova U1.6，Agent记忆模型MemT-1.0-Pro，实时语音与音频理解模型Qwen-Audio-3.1-Live / Captioner。</p>\n  <div data-role=\"outer\" label=\"edit by 135editor\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\">\n   <div data-role=\"outer\" label=\"edit by 135editor\">\n    <blockquote style=\"\">\n     <p><span leaf=\"\">11 月 24 日，今天值得关注的项目覆盖通用推理、多语翻译、图像生成、Agent 记忆与语音交互：腾讯 Hy-MT3 开放覆盖 102 种语言的翻译模型，SenseNova U1.6 引入图像自修正，MemT-1.0-Pro 将原生记忆扩展至更大规模。</span></p>\n    </blockquote>\n    <p style=\"text-align: center;line-height: normal;margin: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">🧠 通用推理与任务执行</span></strong></span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 8px;line-height: 1.45;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">★ GLM-5.4</span></strong></span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 8px;line-height: 1.55;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;color: rgb(255, 104, 39);font-weight: normal;\"><span leaf=\"\">结合视觉理解与编程能力，用代码制作视频、游戏和CAD内容，支持百万Token上下文。</span></span></p>\n    <p style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5703703703703704\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100020518\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124134501_90287a2.png\"></p>\n    <p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\"><span leaf=\"\">11月23日发布的GLM-5.4采用</span><strong><span leaf=\"\">Loop Transformer</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">复用层计算，把视觉理解与编程结合起来。用户可以围绕视频、游戏和CAD等内容提出任务，再由模型通过代码完成制作；百万Token上下文也为处理长材料提供了空间。</span></span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\"><span leaf=\"\">目前可通过GLM Coding Plan、ZCode和网页聊天使用，适合希望在编程工作流中处理更多视觉任务的开发者。</span><strong><span leaf=\"\">独立API仍标注即将开放，模型权重尚未开放</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">，现阶段应按已上线的订阅和产品入口选择使用方式。</span></span></p>\n    <div style=\"margin:0 0 20px;padding:12px 14px;border-left:3px solid #ff6827;background-color:#f8f8f8;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"text-align:left;margin: 0px 0px 6px;line-height: 1.6;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px;color: #ff6827;\"><span leaf=\"\">上手门槛</span></span></strong></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:left;margin: 0px 0px 8px;line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">在线使用</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">：🟢 低｜可通过网页聊天使用</span></span></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:left;margin: 0px 0px 8px;line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">开发接入</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">：🟢 较低｜需订阅GLM Coding Plan｜支持兼容的编程工具</span></span></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:left;text-align-last:left;margin: 0px 0px 8px;line-height: 1.6;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0;word-spacing:normal;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 104, 39);\"><span leaf=\"\">在线体验：</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><a href=\"https://chat.z.ai\" target=\"_blank\">https://chat.z.ai</a></span></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:left;text-align-last:left;margin: 0px 0px 8px;line-height: 1.6;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0;word-spacing:normal;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 104, 39);\"><span leaf=\"\">订阅入口：</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><a href=\"https://z.ai/subscribe\" target=\"_blank\">https://z.ai/subscribe</a></span></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:left;text-align-last:left;margin: 0px;line-height: 1.6;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0;word-spacing:normal;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 104, 39);\"><span leaf=\"\">发布说明：</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><a href=\"https://z.ai/blog/glm-5.4\" target=\"_blank\">https://z.ai/blog/glm-5.4</a></span></p>\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 8px;line-height: 1.45;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">★ Ling-3.2-air</span></strong></span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 8px;line-height: 1.55;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;color: rgb(255, 104, 39);font-weight: normal;\"><span leaf=\"\">处理图文输入、专业文档与终端任务，以稀疏激活模型支持工作流自动化。</span></span></p>\n    <p style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.55\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100020520\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124134501_a408c67.png\"></p>\n    <p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\"><span leaf=\"\">Ling-3.2-air开放通用图文模型权重，采用MoE架构，</span><strong><span leaf=\"\">总参数124B、激活参数5.5B</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">。它面向工作流自动化、专业文档处理和终端任务；官方报告的 AutomationBench-AA 得分由 15.7% 提升至 61%，体现其在该评测任务集上的改进。</span></span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\"><span leaf=\"\">权重采用MIT许可证，适合需要自行部署、进一步适配业务流程的团队。稀疏激活并不意味着只需容纳5.5B权重：官方256K上下文部署示例使用</span><strong><span leaf=\"\">4张141GB级GPU</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">，这是示例配置而非最低要求，部署仍需充足算力。</span></span></p>\n    <div style=\"margin:0 0 20px;padding:12px 14px;border-left:3px solid #ff6827;background-color:#f8f8f8;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"text-align:left;margin: 0px 0px 6px;line-height: 1.6;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px;color: #ff6827;\"><span leaf=\"\">上手门槛</span></span></strong></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:left;margin: 0px 0px 8px;line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">自行部署</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">：🔴 极高｜官方256K部署示例使用4张141GB级GPU｜示例并非最低配置</span></span></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:left;text-align-last:left;margin: 0px;line-height: 1.6;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0;word-spacing:normal;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 104, 39);\"><span leaf=\"\">模型权重：</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/inclusionAI/Ling-3.2-air\" target=\"_blank\">https://huggingface.co/inclusionAI/Ling-3.2-air</a></span></p>\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"text-align: center;line-height: normal;margin: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">🩺 健康信号处理</span></strong></span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 8px;line-height: 1.45;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">★ LingSante-Pulse</span></strong></span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 8px;line-height: 1.55;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;color: rgb(255, 104, 39);font-weight: normal;\"><span leaf=\"\">从心电、脑电、脉搏波及连续血糖数据中提取特征，供下游健康分析任务使用。</span></span></p>\n    <p style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5509259259259259\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100020521\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124134501_b88cbfd.png\"></p>\n    <p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\"><span leaf=\"\">LingSante-Pulse面向生理时序数据，波形模型覆盖ECG心电、EEG脑电和PPG脉搏波，另有处理CGM连续血糖数据的分支。波形模型为</span><strong><span leaf=\"\">16.7M参数</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">，将原始信号转为可用于后续分析的特征表示。</span></span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\"><span leaf=\"\">代码与权重采用MIT许可证，并支持CPU推理，适合研究者和开发者把信号编码能力接入已有分析流程。模型的直接输出是</span><strong><span leaf=\"\">供下游任务使用的特征，而非诊断结论</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">；具体预测或分类任务仍需在这些特征上另行构建。</span></span></p>\n    <div style=\"margin:0 0 20px;padding:12px 14px;border-left:3px solid #ff6827;background-color:#f8f8f8;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"text-align:left;margin: 0px 0px 6px;line-height: 1.6;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px;color: #ff6827;\"><span leaf=\"\">上手门槛</span></span></strong></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:left;margin: 0px 0px 8px;line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">自行部署</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">：🟢 低｜支持CPU推理｜输出特征供下游任务使用</span></span></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:left;text-align-last:left;margin: 0px 0px 8px;line-height: 1.6;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0;word-spacing:normal;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 104, 39);\"><span leaf=\"\">模型权重：</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/inclusionAI/LingSante-Pulse-1.0\" target=\"_blank\">https://huggingface.co/inclusionAI/LingSante-Pulse-1.0</a></span></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:left;text-align-last:left;margin: 0px;line-height: 1.6;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0;word-spacing:normal;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 104, 39);\"><span leaf=\"\">项目源码：</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><a href=\"https://github.com/inclusionAI/LingSante-Pulse\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/inclusionAI/LingSante-Pulse</a></span></p>\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"text-align: center;line-height: normal;margin: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">🌐 多语翻译</span></strong></span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 8px;line-height: 1.45;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">★ 腾讯Hy-MT3</span></strong></span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 8px;line-height: 1.55;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;color: rgb(255, 104, 39);font-weight: normal;\"><span leaf=\"\">翻译102种语言并遵循术语和格式指令，提供从1.8B到30B-A3B的开放模型。</span></span></p>\n    <p style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5509259259259259\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100020522\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124134501_eede8ce.png\"></p>\n    <p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯11月24日开源Hy-MT3，提供1.8B、7B和30B-A3B版本，支持</span><strong><span leaf=\"\">102种语言</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">。模型强调术语与格式指令遵循，可用于游戏本地化，也能串联OCR结果完成翻译；图中文字需先识别，并非直接输入图像。</span></span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\"><span leaf=\"\">官方报告称，30B-A3B在所测非思考模式模型中取得通用翻译总体最佳表现，并提供TransRubric评测。权重采用Apache 2.0许可证，另有FP8与GGUF版本；</span><strong><span leaf=\"\">1.8B版适合轻量部署</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">，选择更大模型则需要增加计算资源。</span></span></p>\n    <div style=\"margin:0 0 20px;padding:12px 14px;border-left:3px solid #ff6827;background-color:#f8f8f8;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"text-align:left;margin: 0px 0px 6px;line-height: 1.6;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px;color: #ff6827;\"><span leaf=\"\">上手门槛</span></span></strong></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:left;margin: 0px 0px 8px;line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">自行部署</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">：🟢 低｜针对1.8B版本｜可选择GGUF权重</span></span></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:left;text-align-last:left;margin: 0px 0px 8px;line-height: 1.6;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0;word-spacing:normal;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 104, 39);\"><span leaf=\"\">1.8B模型权重：</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/tencent/Hy-MT3-1.8B\" target=\"_blank\">https://huggingface.co/tencent/Hy-MT3-1.8B</a></span></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:left;text-align-last:left;margin: 0px;line-height: 1.6;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0;word-spacing:normal;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 104, 39);\"><span leaf=\"\">项目源码：</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy-MT3\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy-MT3</a></span></p>\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"text-align: center;line-height: normal;margin: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">🎨 图像生成与编辑</span></strong></span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 8px;line-height: 1.45;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">★ SenseNova U1.6</span></strong></span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 8px;line-height: 1.55;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;color: rgb(255, 104, 39);font-weight: normal;\"><span leaf=\"\">统一图像理解、生成与编辑，通过对照指令自检再改图，修正信息图中的文字和编号。</span></span></p>\n    <p style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5351851851851852\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100020523\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124134501_ef8c13c.png\"></p>\n    <p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\"><span leaf=\"\">SenseNova-U1.6-8B-MoT将图像理解、生成和编辑放入同一模型。它的</span><strong><span leaf=\"\">自修正流程</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">先生成图像，再对照用户指令写出批评，最后据此修改结果，让模型把发现的问题继续交给自身的图像编辑能力处理。</span></span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\"><span leaf=\"\">本次训练重点包括信息图中的错字、乱码和编号问题，并支持美学增强。模型权重采用</span><strong><span leaf=\"\">Apache 2.0许可证</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">，提供量化版本，支持本地脚本和ComfyUI，方便开发者把生成、自检和编辑接入自己的图像工作流。</span></span></p>\n    <div style=\"margin:0 0 20px;padding:12px 14px;border-left:3px solid #ff6827;background-color:#f8f8f8;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"text-align:left;margin: 0px 0px 6px;line-height: 1.6;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px;color: #ff6827;\"><span leaf=\"\">上手门槛</span></span></strong></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:left;margin: 0px 0px 8px;line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">自行部署</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">：🟡 中｜需加载理解与生成权重｜可选量化与显存卸载</span></span></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:left;text-align-last:left;margin: 0px 0px 8px;line-height: 1.6;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0;word-spacing:normal;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 104, 39);\"><span leaf=\"\">模型权重：</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/sensenova/SenseNova-U1.6-8B-MoT\" target=\"_blank\">https://huggingface.co/sensenova/SenseNova-U1.6-8B-MoT</a></span></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:left;text-align-last:left;margin: 0px;line-height: 1.6;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0;word-spacing:normal;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 104, 39);\"><span leaf=\"\">模型文档：</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><a href=\"https://github.com/OpenSenseNova/SenseNova-U1/blob/main/docs/u1.6_model.md\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/OpenSenseNova/SenseNova-U1/blob/main/docs/u1.6_model.md</a></span></p>\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"text-align: center;line-height: normal;margin: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">🧠 Agent记忆</span></strong></span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 8px;line-height: 1.45;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">★ MemT-1.0-Pro</span></strong></span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 8px;line-height: 1.55;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;color: rgb(255, 104, 39);font-weight: normal;\"><span leaf=\"\">通过动态局部记忆与可训练超记忆保存、恢复任务状态，支持持续运行的Agent。</span></span></p>\n    <p style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.35833333333333334\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100020524\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124134501_dc6b640.png\"></p>\n    <p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\"><span leaf=\"\">MemTensor 新发布 MemT-1.0-Pro，在 Nano、Flash 之后引入以 Nemotron 3 Ultra 为底座的 Pro 版本，官方标注</span><strong><span leaf=\"\">554B总参数、59B激活参数</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">。模型结合动态局部记忆与可训练超记忆，面向需要持续积累任务状态的Agent。</span></span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\"><span leaf=\"\">其记忆可保存并恢复，无需重新加载明文历史，但不应理解为对全部历史的无损、无限保存。权重以</span><strong><span leaf=\"\">OpenMDW 1.1许可证</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">开放；554B规模的BF16权重需要多卡与大内存资源，更适合有大型模型部署能力的团队。</span></span></p>\n    <div style=\"margin:0 0 20px;padding:12px 14px;border-left:3px solid #ff6827;background-color:#f8f8f8;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"text-align:left;margin: 0px 0px 6px;line-height: 1.6;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px;color: #ff6827;\"><span leaf=\"\">上手门槛</span></span></strong></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:left;margin: 0px 0px 8px;line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">自行部署</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">：🔴 极高｜554B规模BF16权重｜需要多卡与大内存资源</span></span></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:left;text-align-last:left;margin: 0px 0px 8px;line-height: 1.6;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0;word-spacing:normal;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 104, 39);\"><span leaf=\"\">模型权重：</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/MemTensor/MemT-1.0-Pro\" target=\"_blank\">https://huggingface.co/MemTensor/MemT-1.0-Pro</a></span></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:left;text-align-last:left;margin: 0px;line-height: 1.6;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0;word-spacing:normal;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 104, 39);\"><span leaf=\"\">项目源码：</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><a href=\"https://github.com/MemTensor/MemT-1.0\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/MemTensor/MemT-1.0</a></span></p>\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"text-align: center;line-height: normal;margin: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">🎙️ 实时语音与音频理解</span></strong></span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 8px;line-height: 1.45;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">★ Qwen-Audio-3.1-Live / Captioner</span></strong></span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 8px;line-height: 1.55;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;color: rgb(255, 104, 39);font-weight: normal;\"><span leaf=\"\">让实时语音对话委派后台任务，并把音频中的说话人、音乐和环境声整理为描述。</span></span></p>\n    <p style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5722222222222222\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100020525\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124134501_64f9bdd.png\"></p>\n    <p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\"><span leaf=\"\">11月23日上线API的Qwen-Audio-3.1-Live支持前台持续对话，同时把任务委派给后台执行工具操作。开发者可让语音交互与任务处理配合运行，围绕</span><strong><span leaf=\"\">边交谈、边执行任务</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">的体验组织应用流程。</span></span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\"><span leaf=\"\">Captioner则面向文件音频描述，覆盖说话人、时间信息、音效、音乐和环境声，采用异步接口，</span><strong><span leaf=\"\">每个文件最长5分钟、最大2GB</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">。两者均通过API提供，未开放权重；应按实时交互或文件分析需求选择对应接入方式。</span></span></p>\n    <div style=\"margin:0 0 20px;padding:12px 14px;border-left:3px solid #ff6827;background-color:#f8f8f8;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"text-align:left;margin: 0px 0px 6px;line-height: 1.6;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px;color: #ff6827;\"><span leaf=\"\">上手门槛</span></span></strong></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:left;margin: 0px 0px 8px;line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">开发接入</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">：🟡 中｜Live需接入实时音频与后台任务｜Captioner使用异步文件接口</span></span></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:left;text-align-last:left;margin: 0px 0px 8px;line-height: 1.6;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0;word-spacing:normal;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 104, 39);\"><span leaf=\"\">Live API文档：</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><a href=\"https://platform.qianwenai.com/docs/developer-guides/speech/qwen-audio-live\" target=\"_blank\">https://platform.qianwenai.com/docs/developer-guides/speech/qwen-audio-live</a></span></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:left;text-align-last:left;margin: 0px;line-height: 1.6;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0;word-spacing:normal;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 104, 39);\"><span leaf=\"\">Captioner API文档：</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><a href=\"https://platform.qianwenai.com/docs/developer-guides/speech/audio-tagging\" target=\"_blank\">https://platform.qianwenai.com/docs/developer-guides/speech/audio-tagging</a></span></p>\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.16018518518518518\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline;\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/UibyxhuYSuFYt0TTs9JRT4IWxcupdR1KlLayfiaslScrBpLvsGWn6aAH1alrFUCWE8R2LVqniaOIh5gXWOSB9Yicd0s0OXvDeDnyBy6FJRe25us/0?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"578\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"93\" data-imgfileid=\"100019429\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731113912_4b4a552.png\"></p>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-ratio=\"1.0287037037037037\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline;\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100019420\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260731113913_d76f4c8.png\"></p>\n    <p nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-ratio=\"0.18518518518518517\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"font-size: 17px;background-color: rgb(254, 254, 254);letter-spacing: 0.578px;width: 578px;vertical-align: baseline;height: auto !important;box-sizing:border-box;\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"578\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"107\" data-imgfileid=\"100013546\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260719181526_bec4651.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type data-value=\"3\"></mp-style-type></p>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "11 月 24 日，智谱 AI 发布 GLM-5.4 视觉编程模型，商汤推出 SenseNova U1.6 图像生成与编辑模型，同时汇总多个 AI 模型动态包括通用推理、多语翻译、Agent 记忆与语音交互等项目。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "11 月 24 日，智谱 AI 发布 GLM-5.4 视觉编程模型，商汤推出 SenseNova U1.6 图像生成与编辑模型，同时汇总多个 AI 模型动态包括通用推理、多语翻译、Agent 记忆与语音交互等项目。",
  "summary": "本文聚焦 2026 年 11 月 24 日值得关注的 AI 模型动态，主要包括：智谱 AI 的 GLM-5.4 视觉编程模型，支持百万 Token 上下文，结合视觉理解与编程能力，可通过代码制作视频、游戏和 CAD 内容；Ling-3.2-air 通用图文模型，采用 MoE 架构，总参数 124B、激活参数 5.5B，MIT 许可证；LingSante-Pulse 健康信号处理模型，16.7M 参数，支持 ECG、EEG、PPG 和 CGM 数据特征提取；腾讯 Hy-MT3 多语翻译模型，覆盖 102 种语言，提供 1.8B、7B 和 30B-A3B 版本；SenseNova U1.6 图像生成与编辑模型，支持自修正流程，Apache 2.0 许可证；MemT-1.0-Pro Agent 记忆模型，554B 总参数、59B 激活参数，OpenMDW 1.1 许可证；以及 Qwen-Audio-3.1-Live 和 Captioner 实时语音与音频理解模型。",
